    {
      "type": "standard",
      "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.herbs.info",
      "summary": "和作物一样，香草需要耕地和水才能生长。\n\n收获后的香草可以放在草方块或泥土上作装饰。\n\n也可以栽进花盆里。",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/herbs/potted.png",
          "caption": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.chapters.herbs.potted_caption",
          "image_width": 110,
          "image_height": 62
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "literal_text": "\n在食品储藏室更新中，新鲜香草可以切碎或研磨，装进香料罐备用。",
          "text": null
        }
      ]
    },
