    {
      "type": "standard",
      "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.herbs.thistle",
      "summary": "蓟是一种花，几乎在主世界的任何生物群系里都能找到。\n\n蓟用来制作凝乳酶，而凝乳酶是做奶酪的必需品。",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/plant/thistle.png",
          "caption": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.chapters.blocks.thistle_caption",
          "image_width": 110,
          "image_height": 62
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "literal_text": "蓟有两格高，开紫粉色的花。\n\n可以用骨粉催熟，种法与高花相同。",
          "text": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "standard",
      "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.herbs.cinn",
      "summary": "肉桂树有两格高，树皮会不断生长，剥下来就能得到肉桂。\n\n肉桂树苗生长在热带生物群系，也能在主世界的箱子里找到。",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/plant/cinn_tree.png",
          "caption": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.chapters.blocks.cinn_caption",
          "image_width": 110,
          "image_height": 62
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "literal_text": "用斧右键树干即可剥皮取肉桂。\n\n只要树皮已经长成，就会掉落一些肉桂。",
          "text": null
        }
      ]
    }
